# Runner discs

A runner build writes all three discs. Do not build only the web disc, only the CD, or only the no-music disc.

From `runner/build`:

```
ninja
```

That is the default target. It links the CD program and produces:

- `build/runner.bin` and `build/runner.cue` (CD audio)
- `build/runner-nomusic.bin` and `build/runner-nomusic.cue`
- `build/runner-web.bin` and `build/runner-web.cue`

The profile build is separate and is not part of this.
